  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Management of Support Measures of the Civil Society Organisations (CSOs) Thematic Programme in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this contract is to provide support to the EU Delegation in Indonesia in managing the support measures accompanying the implementation of the CSO Thematic Programme in Indonesia through organisation of events/activities (including information and communication actions), and to enhance EU cooperation and dialogue with CSOs.</narrative>
  </description>
